// off) and an fr.rtc (`rtc`). It moves on `step`: it shows the instant at the start of the running
// cycle of that level and wakes at its end, and its reading goes no finer. At boot the face has the
// screen; a hub client drawing on the panel takes it (`shown` false) until `show`, or a press of the
// face's button. The time comes from the node's wall clock: the hub's (WELCOME, BEACON, TIME), an
// RTC's below it; the face waits `wait_time_s` after boot before it says the time is not set. mode,
